msgid ""
"We have 60 matches in our dataset, coming from 4 different years. Teams "
"play each other only once in the Six Nations championship, so we will "
"have 4 matches where the same two teams play each other, but only 2 "
"repetitions of unique match as the field factor is relevant to our model "
"and it switches every year. We can combine the arrays of the home and "
"away points to visualize \"matches\" instead of only points from one of "
"the sides, also transform the match dimension into unique team pairings "
"if we add a year dimension."
