msgid ""
"These differences are probably related to how the home advantage changes "
"between teams from year to year mostly, it is not as clear here as we saw"
" with specific matches, but specially lower than ~30 points there seem to"
" be alternating similarities 2014-2016 and 2015-2017. Intuitively, the "
"next step being considered might be trying to incorporate the time "
"dependency somehow, even with something as simple as \"defending "
